In this folder placed files used for building models linking protein circuit topology and free energy of folding, folding and unfolding kinetics. 

1. ACPRO_22avg.csv -- inpud data from the ACPro database
2. KPro.tcv -- inpud data from the ACPro database
3. CT_energy_predict.ipynb -- Jupyter notebook with analysis
4. ACPRO_PSC_VA_v1.csv -- topological data from the ACPro data base protein structures
5. KPro_PSC_VA_v1.csv -- topological data from the KPro data base protein structures
6. KPro_VA_v2.csv -- pre-processed data from the KPro database
7. Pre_processed_PDBs.zip -- archive contening pre-processed pdb structures for analysis
